  "description": "Aki can't find his way home. Everyone seems indifferent to this lost child. Everyone... except Jizo, a strange boy who appeared out of nowhere. Is he a street kid? Will he really take him home? Is Aki right to follow him to the temple where he's leading him? Despite his big smile, Aki struggles to trust his new friend. Especially since a terrifying witch hunts children at nightfall…\n\n*Source: Glénat, Vol. 1, translated*",
